        </p>
        <a href="/#calculator" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 transition">
